    "body": "Looking pretty good!\r\n\r\nI found a couple more places that could benefit from stating the connection:\r\n\r\n- https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#form-submission:missing-value-default\r\n- https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#form-submission:missing-value-default-3\r\n\r\nin both cases it'd be good to update the parenthetical from \"There is no missing value default\" to \"There is no missing value default or invalid value default\".\r\n\r\nAlso, the following would be ideally updated to no longer be parenthetical, since we're trying to make missing and invalid peers:\r\n\r\n- https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#contenteditable:missing-value-default\r\n- https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#the-translate-attribute:missing-value-default\r\n- https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#spelling-and-grammar-checking:missing-value-default\r\n\r\nNice work!",
